## Specification-driven changes

Follow [the specification workflow](docs/spec-workflow.md) for source ownership,
direct/lean/design routing, Backlog handoff and change closure. Use the existing
board at `{{BACKLOG_DIR}}/`; bind `BACKLOG_CWD` to this project root before CLI
operations. Backlog is the sole owner of task state, plans and verification
evidence. OpenSpec's artifact readiness or empty task list does not prove that
the linked Backlog work is complete. Use the workflow's external completion
check before archiving a change.

